### 여행 생성 (Create Trip)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/folders?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "테스트"
}

### 여행 목록 조회 (Get Trips)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/folders?userId=1

### 특정 여행 조회 (Get Trip by ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/folders/2?userId=1

### 여행 수정 (Update Trip)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/folders/2?userId=1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "테스트"
}

### 여행 삭제 (Delete Trip)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/folders/2?userId=1
